  "note": [
    "Planetary Defense's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. PLANETARY-DEFENSE v2 with the 2026-09-17 geometry pass: 10 x 4 x 9, the eye at the middle. The north control bank at CONTROLS, the warning display at LIGHTS (indicator-fault while DEFENSE-FIXED == false, a dead face when it is true -- the review page's switch), banks on both side walls and the small access panel on the east wall.",
    "One opening, south: 1.8 x 2.6 onto Systems Corridor, 4.5 m from the eye through 0.16 m of wall. THE GLIMPSE IS MUCH LESS THAN THE HALLWAY IS. The corridor's far south wall is 12.66 m out and the cone covers 5.06 m of it -- PLAIN WORN CONCRETE -- with the deck-plate floor running unbroken from the threshold to it and the last 3.7 m of its 3.6 m ceiling, which enters the cone 9.0 m out. The corridor's east and west mouths are 6 m off this axis at 8.66 m, where the cone is 1.73 m wide, so nothing of Systems Corridor West, Systems Corridor East or Physical Plant Two is in this doorway however straight the hallway runs, and none of them is in the scene. The corridor is warm-lit from its own strips and reads dimmer and lower than this 4 m room. No door leaf; the Planateree Deefens sign is a panel on the corridor's face of this same wall and cannot be read from in here."
